==Strategy==
It is a really easy stage. Crazed Bahamut should do here just fine. Bring some meatshields too.
But in four crown you need a better loudout. Paris/Cyborg are really good here. Meatshields are must! Because some of the enemies will push. Wall cat/Eraser cat plus one or two more. If you have Ururun wolf you should bring him too. Cyberpunk is very useful too. Because he can slow enemies.

==Trivia==
*Like all [[Never Summer! (Monthly Event)|Never Summer!]] stages, Right here, right meow's Japanese name, Season in the Nyan, references a song, in this case "[https://youtu.be/4Y9OmCUsUBk Season in the Sun]" by  [[wikipedia:Tube (band)|Tube]].
*The name Right here, right meow references the song [[wikipedia:Right Here, Right Now (Fatboy Slim song)|Right Here, Right Now]] by Fatboy Slim.

